00:24:27.530 --> 00:24:27.900
Episode 26

Puncak Sihir

00:24:27.900 --> 00:24:29.990
Episode 26

Puncak Sihir

00:24:20.270 --> 00:24:22.480
Ayo segera,

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:24.190
kita selesaikan.

00:24:21.020 --> 00:24:23.730
Terburuknya,

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:24.280
kita berdua bisa mati.

00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:24.900
Kuserahkan padamu...

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:27.150
Anda hebat sekali.

00:24:23.610 --> 00:24:25.860
Nona Frieren.

00:24:23.610 --> 00:24:25.780
Celah ini

00:24:24.780 --> 00:24:26.780
sepertinya juga tidak berguna.

00:24:26.360 --> 00:24:27.900
Kami berharap

00:24:26.820 --> 00:24:28.150
sebanyak ini.

00:24:25.520 --> 00:24:27.860
Jadi memang

00:24:26.190 --> 00:24:28.410
harus melakukannya.

